WEBVTT

1
00:00.000 --> 00:03.600
Take three numbers: 3, 4, and 7.

2
00:03.600 --> 00:06.000
Add: 3 + 4 = 7.

3
00:06.000 --> 00:08.400
Swap them: 4 + 3 = 7.

4
00:08.400 --> 00:10.800
Take away: 7 − 3 = 4.

5
00:10.800 --> 00:13.200
And: 7 − 4 = 3.

6
00:13.200 --> 00:17.400
These 4 facts use the same 3 numbers. They are a fact family.
